Hi <%= @contact.name %>,

<% if @paper == "agenda" -%>
Here's the agenda for <%= @meeting.title %> on <%= l @meeting.starts_at.in_time_zone, format: :long %> (<%= Time.zone.name %>).

<%= agent_text(@meeting.agenda) %>
<% else -%>
Thanks for your time at <%= @meeting.title %>. Here's what we covered and agreed.

<%= agent_text(@meeting.recap) %>
<% if @meeting.commitments.any? -%>

Action items:
<% @meeting.commitments.order(:due_on).each do |commitment| -%>
- <%= commitment.description %>: <%= commitment.owner_name %>, by <%= l commitment.due_on, format: :long %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
